Orbyn Engineering's web interface follows the visual design of T3 Code
(https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code, revision 50c1c5dc). No T3 Code source
file was copied whole. These files take values or adapt small parts:

  web/src/styles/tokens.css            tokens from apps/web/src/index.css
  web/src/styles/base.css              keyframes from apps/web/src/index.css
  web/src/lib/panelAnimations.ts       from apps/web/src/panelAnimations.ts
  web/src/lib/visibleAnimation.ts      from apps/web/src/lib/visibleAnimation.ts
  web/src/features/thread/heroTransition.ts
      from apps/web/src/components/chat/useDraftHeroLayoutTransition.ts
      and draftHeroTransition.ts

